Chapter: MultilineLiteralApp

 A bare literal on the next line is dropped from a multi-line call.
 CDX1070 now catches literal continuations, not just '(' and '['.

Section: Definitions

  add3 : Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  add3 (a) (b) (c) = a + b + c

  combine : Integer -> Integer
  combine (n) =
    add3 n 1
      2

  opening : Integer = combine 4

